0846dcdf: ;
 .;
 .;The purpose of this routine is to update the **DATE DICTATED** field (#10.01)
 .;of the FEE BASIS file (#393).
 .;
 .;The program performs various checks before allowing the user to update the field,
 .;including verifying the entered date is on or after the EVENT DATE.
 .;
 .;If the DATE DICTATED field is left blank, the INCOMPLETE STATUS multiple
 .;(#393.0103) is updated to 'INCOMPLETE'.
 .;
 .;This routine interacts with the PATIENT FEE BASIS file (#393) and calls DIEQ
 .;to perform field-level input validation.
